c_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCShcwIbzool_AYxUnpoiiQhZy5foIKmvVgVeOpNlCWoQ&oe=6A6DE8DF"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "208131487190015", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974806_637264590133005_3374648889293406208_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1XMNw9RZGqAQ7kNvwG0wgiD&_nc_oc=AdooA6AcC_0xEoCAt54ml4F6tgAZYVV7ehVPrSoLEOpfdqXp0lNz1ppbjv8HdLRvsBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCGI5L16mJOBffNJJhApvQ3lbG-5YffixLbKDqSnYqNRg&oe=6A6DD847"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "233832931080774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974481_703759533426469_9082256724521385984_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yT9AXWs89GQQ7kNvwGOPgIp&_nc_oc=Adp3EheiQSRmLhfwZrdQ_a4AOFRQmrYg9u3T-8fkqEeVrilUC8MDBGA9l0ajoF7-ReU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDtQVbWTwkp-snvmCzRREKQSIcYkrsPi450xtSZmlB4Ng&oe=6A6DF98C"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "205792820732135", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974627_455383378522662_8225256800161628160_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y2N9t_phEgYQ7kNvwFL1yVn&_nc_oc=AdrrAsq4b6MCjwX0ucvV0h6935sPC0yRtfmi58bkQ3xHsDPLM4h3FgwyEu60nqRaIeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAmEL54X1BCxUq1EIiKLNcbeHZxE2BP_vNkJq07KsM3bg&oe=6A6DD7AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Discontinue", "keywords": ["Disc", "Action", "Sport", "Arcade", "Cyber"], "long_description": "Discontinue is a unique competitive Virtual Reality (VR) Arcade game. The ultimate disc launching video game experience. With a retro neon game style. Your goal is to survive in a world of obstacles, where you are welcomed as its champion. As you move through this world, you will encounter all kinds of hexagons obstacles\n\nThe world consists of more than 1000 levels, each generated through a seed which you can share with a friend or a foe to compete for the high score. \n\nEvery seed generates a unique level  by combining handcrafted level pieces. These pieces seamlessly connected in many different orders and variations. All to create action paced gameplay mixed with relaxed puzzle-like or transitional phases.\n\nTunnels are all about dodging and speed, whilst in the arenas you focus on standing your ground and defeating all obstacles in your way.\nThe various phases combined are designed to provide a rich and impactful cyber experience full of new VR action.\n\nAre you up for this challenge?", "short_description": "Discontinue is a new retro room-scale VR Arcade Game. And it's all about launching discs in a Neon/Synthwave style ambience. Use your Disc action skills to set a high score in more than a thousand levels. Compete against friend and foe to set the new high score. \n\nAre you up for this challenge?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "306472380333738", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Discontinue", "keywords": ["\u5706\u76d8", "\u884c\u52a8", "\u8fd0\u52a8", "\u62f1\u5eca", "\u7f51\u7edc"], "long_description": "Discontinue\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u72ec\u7279\u7684\u7ade\u4e89\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\uff08VR\uff09\u8857\u673a\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u7ec8\u6781\u5149\u76d8\u62cd\u6444\u89c6\u9891\u6e38\u620f\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002\u5177\u6709\u590d\u53e4\u9713\u8679\u706f\u6e38\u620f\u98ce\u683c\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u76ee\u6807\u662f\u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u5145\u6ee1\u969c\u788d\u7684\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\u751f\u5b58\uff0c\u5728\u90a3\u91cc\u4f60\u5c06\u53d7\u5230\u6b22\u8fce\u3002\u5f53\u4f60\u7a7f\u8d8a\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u4f1a\u9047\u5230\u5404\u79cd\u5404\u6837\u7684\u969c\u788d\u516d\u89d2\u5f62\n\n\u4e16\u754c\u7531\u8d85\u8fc7\u4e00\u5343\u4e2a\u7ea7\u522b\u7ec4\u6210\uff0c\u6bcf\u4e2a\u7ea7\u522b\u7531\u79cd\u5b50\u751f\u6210\uff0c\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e0e\u670b\u53cb\u6216\u654c\u4eba\u5206\u4eab\u4ee5\u4e89\